  "rationale": "The enrollment binding is not established on one side, so the composition has no resolution to compare. Absence of a resolution is not divergence of resolutions: XP-3 is INDETERMINATE, not REFUSE. Collapsing the two loses the difference between 'these artifacts name different humans' - a conflict that was observed - and 'we cannot tell whose mandate this is' - a missing input. An implementation returning REFUSE for both reports a conflict it never saw."
